msgid ""
"It has been some time ago that changes in the Bible text were received from "
"the Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Dit is 'n geruime tyd gelede dat veranderinge in die Bybelteks van die Cloud"
" ontvang is."

msgid ""
"This will right itself in a little time if you are connected to the "
"Internet."
msgstr "Dit sal binnekort regkom as u aan die Internet gekoppel is."

msgid "If not please do a Send/receive action."
msgstr "Doen asseblief 'n Stuur/ontvang-aksie indien nie."

msgid ""
"There are pending changes in the Bible text that have not yet been sent to "
"the Cloud for some time."
msgstr ""
"Daar is hangende veranderinge in die Bybelteks wat al 'n geruime tyd nie na "
"die Cloud gestuur is nie."

msgid "The Cloud already had some changes in this chapter."
msgstr "Die Cloud het reeds sekere veranderinge in hierdie hoofstuk gehad."

msgid "You sent some changes for this chapter too."
msgstr "U het ook sekere veranderinge vir hierdie hoofstuk gestuur."

msgid "The Cloud merged the two."
msgstr "Die Cloud het die twee saamgevoeg."

msgid "Most likely this is okay."
msgstr "Dit is heel waarskynlik in orde."

msgid "You may want to check the result of the merge, whether it is correct."
msgstr ""
"U wil dalk die resultaat van die samevoeging nagaan om te sien of dit korrek"
" is."

msgid "You have now connected to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "U is nou aan Bibledit Cloud gekoppel."

msgid ""
"While you were disconnected from Bibledit Cloud, you made some changes in "
