msgstr ""
"Terwyl u van Bibledit Cloud ontkoppel was, het u sekere veranderinge in die "
"Bybelteks op u toestel gemaak."

msgid "These changes will not be saved to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Hierdie veranderinge sal nie na Bibledit Cloud gestoor word nie."

msgid "The unsaved text is below."
msgstr "Die ongestoorde teks is hieronder."

msgid ""
"While sending Bible text to Bibledit Cloud, you did not have write access to"
