msgstr "Voer alle moontlike kleinletters in die teks van die Bybel in."

msgid "Enter all possible punctuation marks at the end of a sentence."
msgstr "Voer alle moontlike leestekens aan die einde van 'n sin in."

msgid "Enter all possible punctuation marks within a sentence."
msgstr "Voer alle moontlike leestekens binne 'n sin in."

msgid ""
"Enter all possible characters that should be allowed within a sentence."
msgstr ""
"Voer alle moontlike karakters in wat binne 'n sin toegelaat moet word."

msgid ""
"The characters will be treated by the checks algorithm to be valid in any "
"context."
msgstr ""
"Die karakters sal deur die kontrole-algoritme as geldig in enige konteks "
"beskou word."

msgid ""
"Enter the names, starting with a capital, that may occur after mid-sentence "
"punctuation."
msgstr ""
"Voer die name in, wat met 'n hoofletter begin, wat na 'n leesteken binne 'n "
"sin kan voorkom."

msgid ""
"Enter all possible markers that start a new line but do not necessarily "
"start a new sentence."
msgstr ""
"Voer alle moontlike merkers in wat 'n nuwe reël begin, maar nie noodwendig "
"'n nuwe sin begin nie."

