msgid "Select Bible:"
msgstr "Kies Bybel:"

msgid "This page lists the notifications of the changes in the Bible text."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie bladsy lys die kennisgewings van die veranderinge in die Bybelteks."

msgid "Use the up and down arrow keys to navigate through the entries."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik die op- en af-pyltjiesleutels om deur die inskrywings te navigeer."

msgid "Press the delete key to remove the selected entry."
msgstr "Druk die vee-uit-sleutel om die gekose inskrywing te verwyder."

msgid "Or click the 🗑."
msgstr "Of klik op die 🗑."

msgid "Or swipe it to the left."
msgstr "Of swiep dit na links."

msgid ""
"Use the left and right arrow keys to expand or collapse the selected entry."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik die links- en regs-pyltjiesleutels om die gekose inskrywing uit te "
"brei of in te vou."

msgid "Or click the 📁."
msgstr "Of klik op die 📁."

msgid "Or swipe it to the right."
msgstr "Of swiep dit na regs."

msgid "The expanded entry provides more information and options."
msgstr "Die uitgebreide inskrywing verskaf meer inligting en opsies."

msgid ""
"It displays all the Consultation Notes that refer to the passage of the "
"Change Notification."
msgstr ""
"Dit vertoon al die Konsultasienotas wat na die gedeelte van die "
"Veranderingskennisgewing verwys."

msgid "If you are subscribed to a note, you can unsubscribe."
msgstr "As u op 'n nota ingeskryf is, kan u uitskryf."

msgid "If a note is assigned to you, you can unassign it."
msgstr "As 'n nota aan u toegewys is, kan u die toewysing ophef."

msgid "When you have a Manager role, you can delete a note."
msgstr "Wanneer u 'n Bestuurder-rol het, kan u 'n nota uitvee."

msgid ""
"You can create a new Consultation Note with a query about the change in the "
"text of the Bible."
msgstr ""
"U kan 'n nuwe Konsultasienota skep met 'n navraag oor die verandering in die"
" teks van die Bybel."

msgid "This page with change notifications is for you."
msgstr "Hierdie bladsy met veranderingskennisgewings is vir u."

msgid "Your colleagues have their own lists."
msgstr "U kollegas het hul eie lyste."

msgid "Every day it will detect changes in the Bibles."
msgstr "Elke dag sal dit veranderinge in die Bybels bespeur."

msgid "It will then generate new change notifications based on those changes."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal dan nuwe veranderingskennisgewings op grond van daardie veranderinge"
" genereer."

msgid "It will add these new change notifications to the list."
msgstr "Dit sal hierdie nuwe veranderingskennisgewings by die lys voeg."

msgid "The change notifications fall into several categories:"
msgstr "Die veranderingskennisgewings val in verskeie kategorieë:"

msgid ""
"Those marked with a smiley face are notifications of changes made by you."
msgstr ""
"Dié wat met 'n smiley gemerk is, is kennisgewings van veranderinge wat deur "
"u gemaak is."

msgid ""
"Those marked with the name of a user are notifications of changes made by "
"this user."
msgstr ""
"Dié wat met die naam van 'n gebruiker gemerk is, is kennisgewings van "
"veranderinge wat deur hierdie gebruiker gemaak is."

msgid ""
"Those marked with a book symbol are notifications of changes in the Bible "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Dié wat met 'n boeksimbool gemerk is, is kennisgewings van veranderinge in "
"die Bybelteks."

msgid ""
"They are the result of the combined edits of all users working on this "
"Bible."
msgstr ""
"Hulle is die resultaat van die gekombineerde wysigings van alle gebruikers "
"wat aan hierdie Bybel werk."

msgid ""
"Each category can be enabled or disabled separately in your notifications."
msgstr ""
"Elke kategorie kan afsonderlik in u kennisgewings geaktiveer of gedeaktiveer"
" word."

msgid "Bible translation is a collaborative effort."
msgstr "Bybelvertaling is 'n gesamentlike poging."

msgid ""
"Changes you enter may be updated by others or merged with their changes."
msgstr ""
"Veranderinge wat u invoer, kan deur ander opgedateer of met hul veranderinge"
" saamgevoeg word."

msgid ""
"The different categories of change notifications enable you to find out "
"whether a change is now in the Bible text."
msgstr ""
"Die verskillende kategorieë veranderingskennisgewings stel u in staat om uit"
" te vind of 'n verandering nou in die Bybelteks is."

msgid "Bibledit tracks the changes in the text of the Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit hou die veranderinge in die teks van die Bybels dop."

msgid "It generates lists of them every day."
msgstr "Dit genereer elke dag lyste daarvan."

msgid "Generate them now."
msgstr "Genereer hulle nou."

msgid "Lists with changes can be downloaded."
msgstr "Lyste met veranderinge kan afgelaai word."

msgid ""
"Bibledit emails lists with the changes to users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr ""
"Bibledit stuur lyste met die veranderinge per e-pos aan gebruikers wat "
"daardie kennisgewing geaktiveer het."

msgid ""
"It generates change notifications online for users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr ""
"Dit genereer veranderingskennisgewings aanlyn vir gebruikers wat daardie "
"kennisgewing geaktiveer het."

msgid "Notifications."
msgstr "Kennisgewings."

msgid ""
"The users who have enabled change notification are listed below, with the "
"number of changes waiting for their review."
msgstr ""
"Die gebruikers wat veranderingskennisgewings geaktiveer het, word hieronder "
"gelys, met die aantal veranderinge wat op hul hersiening wag."

msgid "Changes are recorded in the journal."
msgstr "Veranderinge word in die joernaal aangeteken."

msgid ""
"When the Bible text gets pushed to an external git repository, the changes "
"will be visible there."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer die Bybelteks na 'n eksterne git-bewaarplek gestoot word, sal die "
"veranderinge daar sigbaar wees."

