msgid "This page is for configuring the layout of a workspace."
msgstr "Hierdie bladsy is vir die opstel van die uitleg van 'n werkruimte."

msgid ""
"A workspace enables you to display parts of Bibledit or websites side-by-"
"side."
msgstr ""
"'n Werkruimte stel u in staat om dele van Bibledit of webwerwe langs mekaar "
"te vertoon."

msgid "There are three rows:"
msgstr "Daar is drie rye:"

msgid "A top row, a center row, and a bottom row."
msgstr "'n Boonste ry, 'n middelste ry en 'n onderste ry."

msgid "Each row has five columns."
msgstr "Elke ry het vyf kolomme."

msgid "Thus there are 15 possible positions."
msgstr "Dus is daar 15 moontlike posisies."

msgid ""
"You can set the relative height of each of the three rows individually."
msgstr "U kan die relatiewe hoogte van elk van die drie rye afsonderlik stel."

msgid ""
"The height is set as integer factor relative to the browser window height "
"and other panes."
msgstr ""
"Die hoogte word gestel as 'n heelgetalfaktor relatief tot die blaaiervenster"
" se hoogte en ander panele."

msgid ""
"For example use factors of 1 and 2 respectively on two panes to get a split "
"⅓ / ⅔ layout."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik byvoorbeeld faktore van onderskeidelik 1 en 2 op twee panele om 'n ⅓"
" / ⅔-uitleg te kry."

msgid ""
"Or use factors 1, 1, and 2 respectively on three panes for a ¼ / ¼ / ½ "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Of gebruik faktore van onderskeidelik 1, 1 en 2 op drie panele vir 'n ¼ / ¼ "
"/ ½-uitleg."

msgid ""
"You can enter the URLs of internal Bibledit pages or external pages to "
"display."
msgstr ""
"U kan die URL's van interne Bibledit-bladsye of eksterne bladsye invoer om "
"te vertoon."

msgid ""
"Enter their relative widths as an integer factor relative to the overall "
"width and other panes."
msgstr ""
"Voer hul relatiewe breedtes in as 'n heelgetalfaktor relatief tot die "
"algehele breedte en ander panele."

msgid "The factors for the widths work the same as for the heights."
msgstr "Die faktore vir die breedtes werk dieselfde as vir die hoogtes."

msgid ""
"The internal URL of a Bibledit function can be found by opening that "
"function in the web browser, and then copying the last two bits from the URL"
" in the address bar."
msgstr ""
"Die interne URL van 'n Bibledit-funksie kan gevind word deur daardie funksie"
" in die webblaaier oop te maak en dan die laaste twee dele van die URL in "
"die adresbalk te kopieer."

