msgstr "Die Notas-bladsy is"

msgid "Some useful websites with resources that can be embedded are"
msgstr "Sommige nuttige webwerwe met hulpbronne wat ingebed kan word, is"

msgid "There are many more of them."
msgstr "Daar is nog baie meer daarvan."

msgid "To edit two Bibles side-by side, add two editors to the workspace."
msgstr ""
"Om twee Bybels langs mekaar te redigeer, voeg twee redigeerders by die "
"werkruimte."

msgid "Add the following to each of them:"
msgstr "Voeg die volgende by elkeen van hulle:"

