"For example, if one of the Bibles would be a Bible called 'Ndebele Bible', "
"then the URL would be:"
msgstr ""
"As een van die Bybels byvoorbeeld 'n Bybel genaamd 'Ndebele Bible' sou wees,"
" sou die URL wees:"

msgid "The Notes editor has some preset selectors."
msgstr "Die Notas-redigeerder het 'n paar vooraf ingestelde kiesers."

msgid ""
"To display all the notes for a certain passage, enter the following URL:"
msgstr ""
"Om al die notas vir 'n sekere gedeelte te vertoon, voer die volgende URL in:"

msgid ""
"When this workspace will be opened, it will display all the notes that refer"
" to the focused passage."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie werkruimte oopgemaak word, sal dit al die notas vertoon wat "
"na die gefokusde gedeelte verwys."

msgid "Other preset selectors for the Notes editor:"
msgstr "Ander vooraf ingestelde kiesers vir die Notas-redigeerder:"

msgid "Display all notes assigned to you."
msgstr "Vertoon alle notas wat aan u toegewys is."

msgid "Display all notes you are subscribed to."
msgstr "Vertoon alle notas waarop u ingeskryf is."

msgid "Display subscribed notes that have been idle for a day."
msgstr "Vertoon notas waarop ingeskryf is wat 'n dag lank onaktief was."

msgid "Display subscribed notes that have been idle for a week."
msgstr "Vertoon notas waarop ingeskryf is wat 'n week lank onaktief was."

msgid "You can set the width of the entire workspace."
msgstr "U kan die breedte van die hele werkruimte stel."

msgid ""
"By setting the width wider than the screen, the workspace can be scrolled "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""
"Deur die breedte wyer as die skerm te stel, kan die werkruimte horisontaal "
"gerol word."

msgid "This may be useful on devices with smaller screens, such as phones."
msgstr "Dit kan nuttig wees op toestelle met kleiner skerms, soos foon."

msgid "You can set the width as a percentage."
msgstr "U kan die breedte as 'n persentasie stel."

msgid "You can set the width as as a number of pixels."
msgstr "U kan die breedte as 'n aantal piksels stel."

msgid "Paratext bridge"
msgstr "Paratext-brug"

msgid ""
"Bibledit can synchronize its Bibles with projects in Paratext installed on "
"the same computer."
msgstr ""
"Bibledit kan sy Bybels met projekte in Paratext sinchroniseer wat op "
"dieselfde rekenaar geïnstalleer is."

msgid "The synchronization works in both directions."
msgstr "Die sinchronisasie werk in albei rigtings."

msgid ""
"Changes in the Bible text made in Bibledit will be transferred to Paratext."
msgstr ""
"Veranderinge in die Bybelteks wat in Bibledit gemaak is, sal na Paratext "
"oorgedra word."

msgid "And changes made in Paratext will be transferred to Bibledit."
msgstr ""
"En veranderinge wat in Paratext gemaak is, sal na Bibledit oorgedra word."

msgid "Bible in Bibledit"
msgstr "Bybel in Bibledit"

msgid "change"
msgstr "verander"

msgid "disable"
msgstr "deaktiveer"

msgid "Paratext Projects folder"
msgstr "Paratext-projekgids"

msgid "Paratext project"
msgstr "Paratext-projek"

msgid "Take initial data from"
msgstr "Neem aanvanklike data van"

msgid ""
"The first time to synchronize the Bible in Bibledit with the project in "
"Paratext, the system needs to have an authoritative copy of Bible data that "
"overwrites the other."
msgstr ""
"Die eerste keer wat die Bybel in Bibledit met die projek in Paratext "
"gesinchroniseer word, moet die stelsel 'n gesaghebbende kopie van Bybeldata "
"hê wat die ander oorskryf."

msgid ""
"Either the Bible books in the Paratext project overwrite the Bible books in "
"Bibledit."
msgstr ""
"Óf die Bybelboeke in die Paratext-projek oorskryf die Bybelboeke in "
"Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Or the Bible books in Bibledit overwrite the Bible books in the Paratext "
"project"
msgstr ""
"Óf die Bybelboeke in Bibledit oorskryf die Bybelboeke in die Paratext-projek"

msgid "This only occurs once during the setup phase."
msgstr "Dit gebeur net een keer tydens die opstelfase."

msgid ""
"While the Paratext bridge is active, Bibledit updates Paratext Scripture "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Terwyl die Paratext-brug aktief is, werk Bibledit die Paratext-Skrifteks op."

msgid "The updates occur in the Paratext files."
msgstr "Die opdaterings vind in die Paratext-lêers plaas."

msgid ""
"When Paratext is running, and displays a chapter, and the chapter would be "
"updated in the files, then Paratext does not notice the updated files, and "
"does not reload the updated Scripture text."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer Paratext loop en 'n hoofstuk vertoon, en die hoofstuk in die lêers "
"opgedateer word, merk Paratext nie die opgedateerde lêers nie en herlaai nie"
" die opgedateerde Skrifteks nie."

msgid ""
"Then when Paratext saves that chapter, it saves an older copy of the "
"Scripture text, and so undoes the updates made by Bibledit."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer Paratext dan daardie hoofstuk stoor, stoor dit 'n ouer kopie van die"
" Skrifteks, en maak sodoende die opdaterings ongedaan wat deur Bibledit "
"gemaak is."

msgid ""
"Therefore it is important to take care that Bibledit does not update "
"Paratext Scripture text while Paratext is running."
msgstr ""
"Daarom is dit belangrik om toe te sien dat Bibledit nie die Paratext-"
"Skrifteks opdateer terwyl Paratext loop nie."

msgid ""
"The easiest way to achieve this is to not run Bibledit and Paratext "
"simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"Die maklikste manier om dit te bereik, is om nie Bibledit en Paratext "
"gelyktydig te laat loop nie."

msgid "The collaboration is being set up."
msgstr "Die samewerking word opgestel."

