msgid "Hyphenation"
msgstr "Woordafbreking"

msgid "Hyphenation can be used when preparing a Bible for printing."
msgstr ""
"Woordafbreking kan gebruik word wanneer 'n Bybel vir druk voorberei word."

msgid ""
"It allows for more efficient usage of paper, and for more regular appearance"
" of margins at the end of the lines without requiring spacing adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Dit laat doeltreffender gebruik van papier toe, en meer gereelde voorkoms "
"van kantlyne aan die einde van die reëls sonder dat spasiëringsaanpassings "
"nodig is."

msgid ""
"The details of hyphenating properly are complex and dependent on the "
"language, and can interact with other orthographic and typesetting "
"practices."
msgstr ""
"Die besonderhede van korrekte woordafbreking is kompleks en afhanklik van "
"die taal, en kan met ander ortografiese en setpraktyke wissel."

msgid ""
"Hyphenation may not be so important when preparing a Bible for proofreading."
" It is usually regarded important for production quality Bibles."
msgstr ""
"Woordafbreking is dalk nie so belangrik wanneer 'n Bybel vir proeflees "
"voorberei word nie. Dit word gewoonlik as belangrik beskou vir Bybels van "
"produksiegehalte."

msgid ""
"When preparing a Bible in LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, en so on, the "
"wordprocessor itself provides hyphenation algorithms for many languages."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer 'n Bybel in LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, ensovoorts voorberei "
"word, verskaf die woordverwerker self woordafbrekingsalgoritmes vir baie "
"tale."

msgid ""
"If no suitable hyphenation algorithm can be used, perhaps Bibledit can "
"assist to a limited degree."
msgstr ""
"As geen geskikte woordafbrekingsalgoritme gebruik kan word nie, kan Bibledit"
" dalk tot 'n beperkte mate help."

msgid ""
"Bibledit can take the data from a Bible, insert soft hyphens in the words "
"according to a certain algorithm, and then save this data as a new Bible."
msgstr ""
"Bibledit kan die data van 'n Bybel neem, sagte koppeltekens in die woorde "
"invoeg volgens 'n sekere algoritme, en dan hierdie data as 'n nuwe Bybel "
"stoor."

msgid ""
"This new Bible can then be exported to OpenDocument format, and opened in a "
"wordprocessor."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie nuwe Bybel kan dan na OpenDocument-formaat uitgevoer en in 'n "
"woordverwerker oopgemaak word."

msgid ""
"The wordprocessor sees these soft hyphens. When a soft hyphen occurs near "
"the end of the line, it breaks the word there."
msgstr ""
"Die woordverwerker sien hierdie sagte koppeltekens. Wanneer 'n sagte "
"koppelteken naby die einde van die reël voorkom, breek dit die woord daar."

msgid ""
"Bibledit has one hyphenating algorithm. When there is a transition in the "
"text from any character of a first set of characters, to any character of a "
"second set of characters, then the soft hyphen will be inserted at that "
"location in the text."
msgstr ""
"Bibledit het een woordafbrekingsalgoritme. Wanneer daar 'n oorgang in die "
"teks is van enige karakter van 'n eerste stel karakters na enige karakter "
"van 'n tweede stel karakters, sal die sagte koppelteken by daardie plek in "
"die teks ingevoeg word."

msgid "First set of characters"
msgstr "Eerste stel karakters"

msgid "Second set of characters"
msgstr "Tweede stel karakters"

msgid "Enter the sets of characters, and press Save."
msgstr "Voer die stelle karakters in en druk Stoor."

msgid "The Bible where the data will be taken from is:"
msgstr "Die Bybel waarvan die data geneem sal word, is:"

msgid "The Bible where the hyphenated data will be written to is:"
msgstr "Die Bybel waarheen die data met woordafbreking geskryf sal word, is:"

msgid ""
"Insert the soft hyphens according to the settings and view the progress in "
"the Journal."
msgstr ""
"Voeg die sagte koppeltekens in volgens die instellings en bekyk die "
"vordering in die Joernaal."

