msgid "You can delete a USFM resource."
msgstr "U kan 'n USFM-hulpbron uitvee."

msgid "You can convert a USFM resource back to a Bible."
msgstr "U kan 'n USFM-hulpbron terug na 'n Bybel omskep."

msgid "Progress will be visible in the Journal."
msgstr "Vordering sal in die Joernaal sigbaar wees."

msgid "Translated resource"
msgstr "Vertaalde hulpbron"

msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

msgid "Original resource"
msgstr "Oorspronklike hulpbron"

msgid "Language of the original resource"
msgstr "Taal van die oorspronklike hulpbron"

msgid "Language to translate the resource into"
msgstr "Taal om die hulpbron in te vertaal"

msgid ""
"This translated resource will take the original resource as a starting "
"point."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie vertaalde hulpbron sal die oorspronklike hulpbron as beginpunt neem."

msgid ""
"It will send the original resource to Google Translate for translation."
msgstr ""
"Dit sal die oorspronklike hulpbron na Google Translate stuur vir vertaling."

msgid "It then displays the resource as translated by Google Translate."
msgstr "Dit vertoon dan die hulpbron soos deur Google Translate vertaal."

msgid "Note that this is a machine translation."
msgstr "Let daarop dat dit 'n masjienvertaling is."

msgid "It may not be accurate."
msgstr "Dit is dalk nie akkuraat nie."

msgid "Cache the resource on client devices."
msgstr "Kas die hulpbron op kliëntetoestelle."

msgid "Caching makes the resource available offline."
msgstr "Kas maak die hulpbron vanlyn beskikbaar."

msgid "Caching makes a snapshot of the translated resource."
msgstr "Kas maak 'n kiekie van die vertaalde hulpbron."

msgid ""
"If that resource changes after taking the snapshot, the client device does "
"not display those changes."
msgstr ""
"As daardie hulpbron verander nadat die kiekie geneem is, vertoon die "
"kliëntetoestel nie daardie veranderinge nie."

