msgstr "Die volgende hulpbronne word geïnstalleer:"

msgid ""
"Cancelling a resource installation does not erase already installed content."
msgstr ""
"Die kansellering van 'n hulpbroninstallasie vee nie reeds geïnstalleerde "
"inhoud uit nie."

msgid ""
"When installing the resource again, it will continue from where it was "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer die hulpbron weer geïnstalleer word, sal dit voortgaan waar dit "
"gekanselleer is."

msgid "Click a resource for more information on its status."
msgstr "Klik op 'n hulpbron vir meer inligting oor sy status."

msgid ""
"Connect to Bibledit Cloud to have access to the full range of available "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Koppel aan Bibledit Cloud om toegang tot die volle reeks beskikbare "
"hulpbronne te hê."

