msgstr "Genereer die dokument."

msgid "Convert Bible to USFM Resource"
msgstr "Omskep Bybel na USFM-hulpbron"

msgid "You can convert a Bible to a USFM Resource."
msgstr "U kan 'n Bybel na 'n USFM-hulpbron omskep."

msgid "It means that the text of the Bible will be moved to a Resource."
msgstr ""
"Dit beteken dat die teks van die Bybel na 'n Hulpbron verskuif sal word."

msgid "The users can display this resource."
msgstr "Die gebruikers kan hierdie hulpbron vertoon."

msgid "A Resource will be created with the same name and text as the Bible."
msgstr "'n Hulpbron sal geskep word met dieselfde naam en teks as die Bybel."

msgid "When the conversion is complete, the Bible will be deleted."
msgstr "Wanneer die omskakeling voltooi is, sal die Bybel uitgevee word."

msgid "A Bible can be edited, but a USFM Resource cannot."
msgstr "'n Bybel kan geredigeer word, maar 'n USFM-hulpbron nie."

msgid "A Bible can be searched, but a USFM Resource cannot."
msgstr "'n Bybel kan deursoek word, maar 'n USFM-hulpbron nie."

msgid "The USFM Resource uses less space."
msgstr "Die USFM-hulpbron gebruik minder spasie."

msgid "Start the conversion process and view it in the Journal."
msgstr "Begin die omskakelingsproses en bekyk dit in die Joernaal."

msgid "Comparative resource"
msgstr "Vergelykende hulpbron"

msgid "Base resource"
msgstr "Basishulpbron"

msgid "Updated resource"
msgstr "Opgedateerde hulpbron"

msgid "This resource will take the base resource as a starting point."
msgstr "Hierdie hulpbron sal die basishulpbron as beginpunt neem."

msgid "It will compare the updated resource with the base resource."
msgstr "Dit sal die opgedateerde hulpbron met die basishulpbron vergelyk."

msgid ""
"Any words that the updated resource has added as compared to the base "
"resource will be shown in bold."
msgstr ""
"Enige woorde wat die opgedateerde hulpbron bygevoeg het in vergelyking met "
"die basishulpbron, sal in vet gewys word."

msgid "Any words that were removed will be shown in strikethrough."
msgstr "Enige woorde wat verwyder is, sal met 'n deurhaallyn gewys word."

msgid "Characters to remove"
msgstr "Karakters om te verwyder"

msgid ""
"Characters to be removed from the base and updated resources before doing "
"the comparison."
msgstr ""
"Karakters wat uit die basis- en opgedateerde hulpbronne verwyder moet word "
"voordat die vergelyking gedoen word."

msgid "Separate the characters by spaces."
msgstr "Skei die karakters met spasies."

msgid "Example"
msgstr "Voorbeeld"

msgid "Characters to replace"
msgstr "Karakters om te vervang"

msgid ""
"Characters to search for and be replaced in the base and updated resources "
"before doing the comparison."
msgstr ""
"Karakters om voor te soek en te vervang in die basis- en opgedateerde "
"hulpbronne voordat die vergelyking gedoen word."

msgid "Separate the sets by spaces."
msgstr "Skei die stelle met spasies."

msgid "First enter the characters to search for."
msgstr "Voer eers die karakters in om voor te soek."

msgid "Then enter the = sign."
msgstr "Voer dan die = teken in."

msgid "Finally enter the characters to be substituted."
msgstr "Voer ten slotte die karakters in wat as vervanging dien."

msgid "Remove diacritics from the resources before doing the comparison."
msgstr ""
"Verwyder diakritiese tekens uit die hulpbronne voordat die vergelyking "
"gedoen word."

msgid "Do case folding of the resources before doing the comparison."
msgstr ""
"Doen hoofletter-vouing van die hulpbronne voordat die vergelyking gedoen "
"word."

msgid "Caching makes a snapshot of the base and updated resources."
msgstr "Kas maak 'n kiekie van die basis- en opgedateerde hulpbronne."

msgid ""
"If the base or updated resources change after the snapshot, the client "
"device does not display those changes."
msgstr ""
"As die basis- of opgedateerde hulpbronne verander nadat die kiekie geneem "
"is, vertoon die kliëntetoestel nie daardie veranderinge nie."

msgid "Refresh the list of resources from StudyLight."
msgstr "Verfris die lys van hulpbronne van StudyLight."

msgid "User-defined resource"
msgstr "Gebruikergedefinieerde hulpbron"

msgid ""
"To update the user-defined resource, make changes above, and save them."
msgstr ""
"Om die gebruikergedefinieerde hulpbron op te dateer, maak veranderinge "
"hierbo en stoor dit."

msgid "The first line will be the internet address of the resource."
msgstr "Die eerste reël sal die internetadres van die hulpbron wees."

msgid ""
"The next lines will be the names or abbreviations for all the Bible books."
msgstr ""
"Die volgende reëls sal die name of afkortings vir al die Bybelboeke wees."

msgid ""
"When fetching the user-defined resource, Bibledit will take the internet "
"address, and replace the three words in brackets with the values of the "
"passage to fetch."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer die gebruikergedefinieerde hulpbron gehaal word, sal Bibledit die "
"internetadres neem en die drie woorde tussen hakies vervang met die waardes "
"van die gedeelte wat gehaal moet word."

msgid ""
"The book will be replaced with the book name or abbreviation, for example "
"Matthew."
msgstr ""
"Die boek sal vervang word met die boeknaam of afkorting, byvoorbeeld "
"Matteus."

msgid ""
"The chapter and the verse will be replaced with the appropriate numbers."
msgstr "Die hoofstuk en die vers sal met die toepaslike getalle vervang word."

msgid "Create a new empty image resource"
msgstr "Skep 'n nuwe leë prenthulpbron"

msgid ""
"Image resources provide a way to display scanned pages of a Bible or book."
msgstr ""
"Prenthulpbronne bied 'n manier om geskandeerde bladsye van 'n Bybel of boek "
"te vertoon."

msgid "Each page can be one or more images."
msgstr "Elke bladsy kan een of meer prente wees."

msgid "Each image refers to a range of verses."
msgstr "Elke prent verwys na 'n reeks verse."

msgid ""
"When Bibledit has a certain passage focused, it can display the matching "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer Bibledit 'n sekere gedeelte gefokus het, kan dit die ooreenstemmende"
" prent vertoon."

