msgstr "As administrateur kan u verstekhulpbronne vir u span organiseer."

msgid ""
"Refresh the list of modules from the SWORD servers and view the progress in "
"the journal."
msgstr ""
"Verfris die lys van modules van die SWORD-bedieners en bekyk die vordering "
"in die joernaal."

msgid ""
"When a module is going to be displayed as a resource, it will be installed "
"on the fly."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer 'n module as 'n hulpbron vertoon gaan word, sal dit dadelik "
"geïnstalleer word."

msgid ""
"Update SWORD modules that have a newer version and view the progress in the "
"journal."
msgstr ""
"Dateer SWORD-modules op wat 'n nuwer weergawe het en bekyk die vordering in "
"die joernaal."

msgid "Every week modules update   automatically."
msgstr "Elke week word modules outomaties opgedateer."

msgid ""
"Installed SWORD modules that have not been used for a week will be "
"uninstalled."
msgstr ""
"Geïnstalleerde SWORD-modules wat vir 'n week nie gebruik is nie, sal "
"gedeïnstalleer word."

msgid "Bibledit can display this resource."
msgstr "Bibledit kan hierdie hulpbron vertoon."

msgid "It fetches the resource from the Internet."
msgstr "Dit haal die hulpbron van die Internet."

msgid "Bibledit may not always be able to reach the Internet."
msgstr "Bibledit kan dalk nie altyd die Internet bereik nie."

msgid "Or the connection is slow."
msgstr "Of die verbinding is stadig."

msgid "You can install the resource."
msgstr "U kan die hulpbron installeer."

msgid ""
"When the resource is displayed, the content is fetched from the installed "
"copy, rather than from the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer die hulpbron vertoon word, word die inhoud van die geïnstalleerde "
