msgstr ""
"Bibledit is so ontwerp dat die gebruiker onder normale omstandighede nooit "
"hoef af te meld nie."

msgid "I understand it and want to disconnect from the Cloud."
msgstr "Ek verstaan dit en wil van die Cloud ontkoppel."

msgid "This page deals with setting up the email system."
msgstr "Hierdie bladsy handel oor die opstel van die e-posstelsel."

msgid ""
"Bibledit sends out email. It also collects email every five minutes and acts"
