msgid "It needs an external email account for sending and receiving email."
msgstr ""
"Dit het 'n eksterne e-posrekening nodig om e-pos te stuur en te ontvang."

msgid "The help information on this page uses a sample Google mail account."
msgstr ""
"Die hulpinligting op hierdie bladsy gebruik 'n voorbeeld-Google-posrekening."

msgid "You will have your own email account dedicated to Bibledit."
msgstr "U sal u eie e-posrekening hê wat aan Bibledit gewy is."

msgid ""
"The sample email address is bibletranslation@gmail.com, and the password is "
"pazzwrd."
msgstr ""
"Die voorbeeld-e-posadres is bibletranslation@gmail.com, en die wagwoord is "
"pazzwrd."

msgid "Google now recommends two-factor authentication to be enabled."
msgstr "Google beveel nou aan dat tweefaktor-verifikasie geaktiveer word."

msgid "The password to log into the Google account will not work in Bibledit."
msgstr ""
"Die wagwoord om by die Google-rekening aan te meld sal nie in Bibledit werk "
"nie."

msgid ""
"Instead create an App Password on Google and use that as the password below."
msgstr ""
"Skep in plaas daarvan 'n App-wagwoord by Google en gebruik dit as die "
"wagwoord hieronder."

msgid ""
"In case the setup fails to work, all diagnostics can be seen in the Journal."
msgstr ""
"Indien die opstelling nie werk nie, kan alle diagnostiek in die Joernaal "
"gesien word."

