msgstr "Kies redigeerder"

msgid ""
"This shows how many verses each chapter of the Bible has according to this "
"versification system, and how many chapters each book has."
msgstr ""
"Dit wys hoeveel verse elke hoofstuk van die Bybel volgens hierdie "
"versifikasiestelsel het, en hoeveel hoofstukke elke boek het."

msgid "It can be edited further down the page."
msgstr "Dit kan verder af op die bladsy geredigeer word."

msgid "Delete this versification."
msgstr "Vee hierdie versifikasie uit."

