msgstr "Koppel aan Bibledit Cloud via kieslys Instellings / Cloud."

msgid "Discussions"
msgstr "Besprekings"

msgid ""
"It is important that the more difficult or important passages of the "
"translation are discussed by the Translation Team."
msgstr ""
"Dit is belangrik dat die moeiliker of belangriker gedeeltes van die "
"vertaling deur die Vertaalspan bespreek word."

msgid ""
"All the members of the Translation Team have the intention to produce a "
"reliable translation."
msgstr ""
"Al die lede van die Vertaalspan het die voorneme om 'n betroubare vertaling "
"te lewer."

msgid ""
"But the views of the members about how to best put this reliable translation"
" into words may differ."
msgstr ""
"Maar die lede se sienings oor hoe om hierdie betroubare vertaling die beste "
"in woorde te vervat, kan verskil."

msgid ""
"All members will listen to each other's arguments, bring their own "
"arguments, and come to a conclusion."
msgstr ""
"Alle lede sal na mekaar se argumente luister, hul eie argumente inbring, en "
"tot 'n gevolgtrekking kom."

msgid ""
"The conclusion can be reached because everybody agrees, or it can be reached"
" by vote, or by consulting others, or a combination of this."
msgstr ""
"Die gevolgtrekking kan bereik word omdat almal saamstem, of deur stemming, "
"of deur ander te raadpleeg, of 'n kombinasie hiervan."

msgid "Discussions shall be guided by the following rules:"
msgstr "Besprekings sal deur die volgende reëls gelei word:"

msgid ""
"If a member of the Team wishes to raise an issue for discussion, that member"
" shall create a consultation note for the team."
msgstr ""
"As 'n lid van die Span 'n saak ter bespreking wil opper, sal daardie lid 'n "
"konsultasienota vir die span skep."

msgid "The consultation note will be distributed to all members of the team."
msgstr "Die konsultasienota sal aan alle lede van die span versprei word."

msgid ""
"To give members time to think about the issues, and thus make the discussion"
" more productive, the consultation note shall not be discussed immediately, "
"but after a day or more."
msgstr ""
"Om lede tyd te gee om oor die sake na te dink, en sodoende die bespreking "
"meer produktief te maak, sal die konsultasienota nie dadelik bespreek word "
"nie, maar na 'n dag of meer."

msgid "The consultation note clearly describes the issue or question."
msgstr "Die konsultasienota beskryf die saak of vraag duidelik."

msgid ""
"If the member desires a change, the member shall include a clear suggestion "
"for change in the consultation note."
msgstr ""
"As die lid 'n verandering verlang, sal die lid 'n duidelike voorstel vir "
"verandering in die konsultasienota insluit."

msgid "The members of the team shall choose a chair person."
msgstr "Die lede van die span sal 'n voorsitter kies."

msgid ""
"The chair person leads the discussions, keeps the discussions on topic, "
"ensures that procedures are followed, and keeps the time."
msgstr ""
"Die voorsitter lei die besprekings, hou die besprekings by die onderwerp, "
"sorg dat prosedures gevolg word, en hou die tyd."

msgid "The members of the team are all busy and their time is valuable."
msgstr "Die lede van die span is almal besig en hul tyd is waardevol."

msgid "Therefore discussions should be kept short and to the point."
msgstr "Daarom moet besprekings kort en saaklik gehou word."

msgid ""
"Personal reflections and deliberations about a passage shall not be done in "
"the team, while others are held in suspense."
msgstr ""
"Persoonlike oordenkings en oorwegings oor 'n gedeelte sal nie in die span "
"gedoen word terwyl ander in spanning gehou word nie."

msgid ""
"Everybody shall hold such deliberations in his own time without disturbing "
"others."
msgstr ""
"Elkeen sal sulke oorwegings in sy eie tyd doen sonder om ander te steur."

msgid ""
"If discussion of a consultation note is dragging on, let's say for more than"
" 5 minutes, a vote shall be taken so as to arrive at a decision."
msgstr ""
"As die bespreking van 'n konsultasienota aansleep, laat ons sê vir meer as 5"
" minute, sal 'n stemming gehou word om tot 'n besluit te kom."

msgid ""
"If a member is not satisfied with the outcome of a discussion, that member "
"can forward the consultation note to other appropriate bodies who are able "
"to advise the translation team."
msgstr ""
"As 'n lid nie tevrede is met die uitkoms van 'n bespreking nie, kan daardie "
"lid die konsultasienota aan ander toepaslike liggame deurstuur wat die "
"vertaalspan kan adviseer."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the original language, then it will be forwarded to "
"the Bible Society."
msgstr ""
"As die saak die oorspronklike taal betref, sal dit aan die Bybelgenootskap "
"deurgestuur word."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the local language, the matter should be forwarded to"
" the group of language scholars."
msgstr ""
"As die saak die plaaslike taal betref, moet die saak aan die groep "
"taalkundiges deurgestuur word."

msgid ""
"If the answer from the scholars does not satisfy any member of the team, the"
" matter can be forwarded to the panel consisting of local Church leaders and"
" scholars."
msgstr ""
"As die antwoord van die taalkundiges nie enige lid van die span tevredestel "
"nie, kan die saak aan die paneel van plaaslike Kerkleiers en geleerdes "
"deurgestuur word."

msgid ""
"If a consultation notes has gone through the advising bodies, and a "
"rendering is arrived at by the majority of the members of the translation "
"team, and this rendering does not satisfy a team member, that member can ask"
" the matter to be forwarded to three able Church leaders."
msgstr ""
"As 'n konsultasienota deur die adviserende liggame gegaan het, en die "
"meerderheid van die lede van die vertaalspan 'n weergawe bereik, en hierdie "
"weergawe nie 'n spanlid tevredestel nie, kan daardie lid vra dat die saak "
"aan drie bekwame Kerkleiers deurgestuur word."

msgid ""
"Those able Church leaders have knowledge of Hebrew and Greek, of good "
"commentaries and other reference materials."
msgstr ""
"Daardie bekwame Kerkleiers het kennis van Hebreeus en Grieks, van goeie "
"kommentare en ander naslaanmateriaal."

msgid ""
"The questions sent to them should be worded such that it places a low demand"
" on their time."
msgstr ""
"Die vrae wat aan hulle gestuur word, moet so geformuleer wees dat dit min "
"van hul tyd vra."

msgid ""
"The matter shall include the discussions of the translation team, the answer"
" given by the Bible Society, shall state the rendering chosen by the "
"majority of the team, and the alternate rendering."
msgstr ""
"Die saak sal die besprekings van die vertaalspan insluit, die antwoord wat "
"die Bybelgenootskap gegee het, sal die weergawe wat deur die meerderheid van"
" die span gekies is, en die alternatiewe weergawe vermeld."

msgid ""
"The able Church leaders shall be asked whether they choose the majority "
"rendering or the alternate."
msgstr ""
"Die bekwame Kerkleiers sal gevra word of hulle die meerderheidsweergawe of "
"die alternatief kies."

msgid ""
"They shall be informed that their choice defaults to the majority if no "
"response has been received by the translation team within a month."
msgstr ""
"Hulle sal ingelig word dat hul keuse by verstek die meerderheid is as geen "
"antwoord binne 'n maand deur die vertaalspan ontvang is nie."

msgid ""
"A vote shall be taken from the answers given by the Bible Society and each "
"of the able Church leaders."
msgstr ""
"'n Stemming sal gehou word uit die antwoorde wat deur die Bybelgenootskap en"
" elk van die bekwame Kerkleiers gegee is."

msgid ""
"If the vote needs to be split, equal votes will be given to each of the "
"members of the translation team."
msgstr ""
"As die stemming verdeel moet word, sal gelyke stemme aan elk van die lede "
"van die vertaalspan gegee word."

