"Scripture quotations, or other quoted text, appearing in the introduction."
msgstr ""
"Skrifaanhalings, of ander aangehaalde teks, wat in die inleiding voorkom."

msgid "Explanatory or bridge text"
msgstr "Verduidelikende of oorbruggingsteks"

