msgstr ""
"Opsioneel ingesluit om die einde van die inleidingsmateriaal uitdruklik aan "
"te dui."

msgid "Major title"
msgstr "Hooftitel"

msgid "The main title of the book, if single level."
msgstr "Die hooftitel van die boek, indien enkelvlak."

msgid "Major title level 1"
msgstr "Hooftitel vlak 1"

msgid "The main title of the book, level 1 if multiple levels."
msgstr "Die hooftitel van die boek, vlak 1 indien veelvlak."

msgid "Major title level 2"
msgstr "Hooftitel vlak 2"

msgid "The main title of the book, level 2."
msgstr "Die hooftitel van die boek, vlak 2."

msgid "Major title level 3"
msgstr "Hooftitel vlak 3"

msgid "A secondary title, less important than the main title."
msgstr "'n Sekondêre titel, minder belangrik as die hooftitel."

msgid "Major title level 4"
msgstr "Hooftitel vlak 4"

msgid "A small secondary title sometimes occurring within parentheses."
msgstr "'n Klein sekondêre titel wat soms binne hakies voorkom."

msgid "Major title at ending"
msgstr "Hooftitel aan die einde"

msgid ""
"The main title of the book repeated at the end of the book, if single level."
msgstr ""
"Die hooftitel van die boek herhaal aan die einde van die boek, indien "
"enkelvlak."

msgid "Major title at ending level 1"
msgstr "Hooftitel aan die einde vlak 1"

msgid ""
"The main title of the book repeated at the end of the book, if multiple "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"Die hooftitel van die boek herhaal aan die einde van die boek, indien "
"veelvlak."

msgid "Major title at ending level 2"
msgstr "Hooftitel aan die einde vlak 2"

msgid "A secondary title occurring before or after the ending main title."
msgstr "'n Sekondêre titel wat voor of na die eindhooftitel voorkom."

msgid "Major section heading"
msgstr "Hoofafdelingsopskrif"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "'n Hoofafdelingsindelingopskrif, vlak 1, indien enkelvlak."

msgid "Major section heading level 1"
msgstr "Hoofafdelingsopskrif vlak 1"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "'n Hoofafdelingsindelingopskrif, vlak 1, indien veelvlak."

msgid "Major section heading level 2"
msgstr "Hoofafdelingsopskrif vlak 2"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 2."
msgstr "'n Hoofafdelingsindelingopskrif, vlak 2."

msgid "Major section reference range"
msgstr "Hoofafdelingsverwysingsreeks"

msgid "The text reference range listed under a major section heading."
msgstr ""
"Die verwysingsreeks van die teks wat onder 'n hoofafdelingsopskrif gelys "
"word."

msgid "Section heading"
msgstr "Afdelingsopskrif"

msgid "A section heading, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "'n Afdelingsopskrif, vlak 1, indien enkelvlak."

msgid "Section heading level 1"
msgstr "Afdelingsopskrif vlak 1"

msgid "A section heading, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "'n Afdelingsopskrif, vlak 1, indien veelvlak."

msgid "Section heading level 2"
msgstr "Afdelingsopskrif vlak 2"

msgid "A section heading, level 2."
msgstr "'n Afdelingsopskrif, vlak 2."

msgid "Section heading level 3"
msgstr "Afdelingsopskrif vlak 3"

msgid "A section heading, level 3."
msgstr "'n Afdelingsopskrif, vlak 3."

msgid "Section heading level 4"
msgstr "Afdelingsopskrif vlak 4"

msgid "A section heading, level 4."
msgstr "'n Afdelingsopskrif, vlak 4."

msgid "Section reference range"
msgstr "Afdelingsverwysingsreeks"

msgid "The text reference range listed under a section heading."
msgstr ""
"Die verwysingsreeks van die teks wat onder 'n afdelingsopskrif gelys word."

msgid "Parallel passage references"
msgstr "Parallelle gedeelteverwysings"

msgid "Parallel references."
msgstr "Parallelle verwysings."

msgid "Inline quotation references"
msgstr "Inlyn-aanhalingsverwysings"

msgid ""
"A cross-reference indicating the source text for the preceding quotation."
msgstr ""
"'n Kruisverwysing wat die brontekst vir die voorafgaande aanhaling aandui."

msgid "Descriptive title or Hebrew subtitle"
msgstr "Beskrywende titel of Hebreeuse subtitel"

msgid "A Hebrew text heading, to provide description, e.g. Psalms."
msgstr "'n Hebreeuse tekopskrif, om beskrywing te gee, bv. Psalms."

msgid "Speaker"
msgstr "Spreker"

msgid "A heading to identify the speaker."
msgstr "'n Opskrif om die spreker te identifiseer."

msgid "Semantic division"
msgstr "Semantiese indeling"

msgid ""
"Vertical space used to divide the text into sections, in a manner similar to"
" the structure added through the use of a sequence of heading texts."
msgstr ""
"Vertikale spasie wat gebruik word om die teks in afdelings te verdeel, op 'n"
" manier soortgelyk aan die struktuur wat deur 'n reeks opskrifteks bygevoeg "
"word."

msgid "Semantic division level 1"
msgstr "Semantiese indeling vlak 1"

msgid "Semantic division level 2"
msgstr "Semantiese indeling vlak 2"

msgid "Semantic division level 3"
msgstr "Semantiese indeling vlak 3"

msgid "Semantic division level 4"
msgstr "Semantiese indeling vlak 4"

msgid "Chapter number"
msgstr "Hoofstuknommer"

msgid "For the chapter number."
msgstr "Vir die hoofstuknommer."

msgid "Alternate chapter number"
msgstr "Alternatiewe hoofstuknommer"

msgid ""
"Second or alternate chapter number. For coding dual versification. Useful "
"for places where different traditions of chapter breaks need to be supported"
" in the same translation."
msgstr ""
"Tweede of alternatiewe hoofstuknommer. Vir die kodering van dubbele "
"versifikasie. Nuttig vir plekke waar verskillende tradisies van "
"hoofstukbreke in dieselfde vertaling ondersteun moet word."

msgid "Chapter label"
msgstr "Hoofstuketiket"

msgid ""
"Chapter label used for translations that add a word such as 'Chapter' before"
" chapter numbers, e.g. Psalms."
msgstr ""
"Hoofstuketiket wat gebruik word vir vertalings wat 'n woord soos 'Hoofstuk' "
"voor hoofstuknommers byvoeg, bv. Psalms."

msgid "Published chapter character"
msgstr "Gepubliseerde hoofstukkarakter"

msgid ""
"Published chapter number. This is a chapter marking that would be used in "
"the published text."
msgstr ""
"Gepubliseerde hoofstuknommer. Dit is 'n hoofstukmerk wat in die "
"gepubliseerde teks gebruik sou word."

msgid "Chapter description"
msgstr "Hoofstukbeskrywing"

msgid "For a brief description of the chapter content."
msgstr "Vir 'n kort beskrywing van die hoofstukinhoud."

msgid "Verse number"
msgstr "Versnommer"

msgid "A verse number."
msgstr "'n Versnommer."

msgid "Alternate verse number"
msgstr "Alternatiewe versnommer"

msgid "Second or alternate verse number. For coding dual verse numeration."
msgstr ""
"Tweede of alternatiewe versnommer. Vir die kodering van dubbele "
"versnommering."

msgid "Published verse marker"
msgstr "Gepubliseerde versmerker"

msgid ""
"Published verse marker. This is a verse marking that would be used in the "
"published text."
msgstr ""
"Gepubliseerde versmerker. Dit is 'n versmerk wat in die gepubliseerde teks "
"gebruik sou word."

msgid "Normal paragraph"
msgstr "Normale paragraaf"

msgid "Paragraph text, with first line indent."
msgstr "Paragraafteks, met eerste reël-inkeping."

msgid "Continuation paragraph"
msgstr "Vervolgparagraaf"

msgid "Margin paragraph text, with no first line indent."
msgstr "Kantparagraafteks, sonder eerste reël-inkeping."

msgid "Paragraph opening an epistle"
msgstr "Paragraaf wat 'n brief open"

msgid "Paragraph opening an epistle or letter, without first line indent."
msgstr "Paragraaf wat 'n brief of epistel open, sonder eerste reël-inkeping."

msgid "Right-aligned paragraph"
msgstr "Regs uitgelyn paragraaf"

msgid "Right-aligned paragraph text, without first line indent."
msgstr "Regs uitgelyn paragraafteks, sonder eerste reël-inkeping."

msgid "Closure of a letter"
msgstr "Afsluiting van 'n brief"

msgid "For a closure of an letter."
msgstr "Vir 'n afsluiting van 'n brief."

msgid "Embedded text opening"
msgstr "Ingebedde teksopening"

msgid "For an embedded text opening."
msgstr "Vir 'n ingebedde teksopening."

msgid "Embedded text paragraph"
msgstr "Ingebedde tekparagraaf"

msgid "For an embedded text paragraph."
msgstr "Vir 'n ingebedde tekparagraaf."

msgid "Embedded text closing"
msgstr "Ingebedde teksafsluiting"

msgid "For an embedded text closing."
msgstr "Vir 'n ingebedde teksafsluiting."

msgid "Embedded text refrain"
msgstr "Ingebedde tekskoor"

msgid "Embedded text refrain, e.g. Then all the people shall say, Amen!"
msgstr "Ingebedde tekskoor, bv. Dan sal die hele volk sê: Amen!"

msgid "Indented paragraph"
msgstr "Ingekeepte paragraaf"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 1 indent if single level, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr ""
"Paragraafteks, vlak 1 inkeping indien enkelvlak, met eerste reël-inkeping; "
"word dikwels vir diskoers gebruik."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 1"
msgstr "Ingekeepte paragraaf vlak 1"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 1 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr ""
"Paragraafteks, vlak 1 inkeping indien veelvlak, met eerste reël-inkeping; "
"word dikwels vir diskoers gebruik."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 2"
msgstr "Ingekeepte paragraaf vlak 2"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 2 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr ""
"Paragraafteks, vlak 2 inkeping indien veelvlak, met eerste reël-inkeping; "
"word dikwels vir diskoers gebruik."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 3"
msgstr "Ingekeepte paragraaf vlak 3"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 3 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr ""
"Paragraafteks, vlak 3 inkeping indien veelvlak, met eerste reël-inkeping; "
"word dikwels vir diskoers gebruik."

msgid "Indented flush left paragraph"
msgstr "Ingekeepte links-uitgelyn paragraaf"

