"Margin paragraph text, indented, with no first line indent, often used for "
"discourse."
msgstr ""
"Kantparagraafteks, ingekeep, sonder eerste reël-inkeping, dikwels vir "
"diskoers gebruik."

msgid "No break with previous paragraph"
msgstr "Geen breuk met vorige paragraaf"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, with no break from previous paragraph text at chapter "
"boundary."
msgstr ""
"Paragraafteks, sonder breuk van vorige paragraafteks by hoofstukgrens."

msgid "Centered paragraph"
msgstr "Gesentreerde paragraaf"

msgid "Paragraph text, centered, for inscription."
msgstr "Paragraafteks, gesentreer, vir inskripsie."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent"
msgstr "Paragraaf met hangende inkeping"

