msgid "Footnote"
msgstr "Voetnoot"

msgid "A footnote text item."
msgstr "'n Voetnoot-teksitem."

msgid "Endnote"
msgstr "Eindnoot"

msgid "An endnote text item."
msgstr "'n Eindnoot-teksitem."

msgid "Footnote origin reference"
msgstr "Voetnoot-oorsprongverwysing"

msgid "This is the chapter and verse or verses that note refers to."
msgstr "Dit is die hoofstuk en vers of verse waarna die nota verwys."

msgid "Footnote translation quotation"
msgstr "Voetnoot-vertalingaanhaling"

msgid ""
"A quotation from the current scripture text translation for which the note "
"is being provided."
msgstr ""
"'n Aanhaling uit die huidige Skrifteksvertaling waarvoor die nota verskaf "
"word."

msgid "Footnote alternate translation"
msgstr "Voetnoot-alternatiewe vertaling"

msgid ""
"Used to distinguish between a quotation of the current scripture text "
"translation, and an alternate translation."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik om te onderskei tussen 'n aanhaling uit die huidige "
"Skrifteksvertaling en 'n alternatiewe vertaling."

msgid "Footnote keyword"
msgstr "Voetnoot-sleutelwoord"

msgid ""
"The specific keyword or term from the text for which the footnote is being "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"Die spesifieke sleutelwoord of term uit die teks waarvoor die voetnoot "
"verskaf word."

msgid "Footnote label text"
msgstr "Voetnoot-etiketteks"

msgid ""
"Can be used for labeling word(s) which are used consistently across certain "
"types of translation notes, such as the words 'Or' in an alternative "
"translation note, 'Others', 'Heb.', 'LXX' etc."
msgstr ""
"Kan gebruik word om woord(e) te etiketteer wat konsekwent oor sekere soorte "
"vertaalnotas gebruik word, soos die woorde 'Of' in 'n alternatiewe "
"vertalingsnota, 'Ander', 'Heb.', 'LXX', ens."

msgid "Footnote witness list"
msgstr "Voetnoot-getuielys"

msgid ""
"For distinguishing a list of sigla representing witnesses in critical "
"editions."
msgstr ""
"Om 'n lys van sigla te onderskei wat getuies in kritiese uitgawes "
"verteenwoordig."

msgid "Footnote additional paragraph"
msgstr "Voetnoot-bykomende paragraaf"

msgid ""
"Use this marker to if you need to indicate the start of a new paragraph "
"within a footnote."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik hierdie merker as u die begin van 'n nuwe paragraaf binne 'n "
"voetnoot moet aandui."

msgid "Footnote verse number"
msgstr "Voetnoot-versnommer"

msgid "A verse number within the footnote text."
msgstr "'n Versnommer binne die voetnootteks."

msgid "Footnote text"
msgstr "Voetnootteks"

msgid "The essential or explanatory text of the footnote."
msgstr "Die essensiële of verklarende teks van die voetnoot."

msgid "Footnote Deuterocanonical content"
msgstr "Voetnoot-Deuterokanonieke inhoud"

msgid ""
"Text between these markers is material to be included only in published "
"editions that contain the Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr ""
"Teks tussen hierdie merkers is materiaal wat slegs by gepubliseerde uitgawes"
" ingesluit moet word wat die Deuterokanonieke boeke bevat."

msgid "Footnote reference mark"
msgstr "Voetnoot-verwysingsmerk"

msgid "An additional footnote marker location for a previous footnote."
msgstr "'n Bykomende voetnootmerkerligging vir 'n vorige voetnoot."

msgid "Cross reference"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing"

msgid "A list of cross references."
msgstr "'n Lys van kruisverwysings."

msgid "Cross reference origin reference"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing-oorsprongverwysing"

msgid ""
"This is the chapter and verse or verses that target references are being "
"provided for."
msgstr ""
"Dit is die hoofstuk en vers of verse waarvoor teikenverwysings verskaf word."

msgid "Cross reference keyword"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing-sleutelwoord"

msgid ""
"A keyword from the scripture translation text which the target references "
"also refer to."
msgstr ""
"'n Sleutelwoord uit die Skrifvertalingsteks waarna die teikenverwysings ook "
"verwys."

msgid "Cross reference quotation"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing-aanhaling"

msgid "A cross reference quotation from the scripture text."
msgstr "'n Kruisverwysingsaanhaling uit die Skrifteks."

msgid "Cross reference target references"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing-teikenverwysings"

msgid "The cross reference target references."
msgstr "Die kruisverwysing-teikenverwysings."

msgid "Target references added text"
msgstr "Teikenverwysings bygevoegde teks"

msgid "Used for marking text added to the target references."
msgstr "Gebruik om teks te merk wat by die teikenverwysings gevoeg is."

msgid "Published cross reference origin text"
msgstr "Gepubliseerde kruisverwysing-oorsprongteks"

msgid "Supplies the origin text intended for publishing."
msgstr "Verskaf die oorsprongteks wat vir publisering bedoel is."

msgid "Cross reference Old Testament"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing Ou Testament"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Old Testament books."
msgstr ""
"Inhoud tussen hierdie merkers is vir insluiting in uitgawes wat die Ou "
"Testament-boeke bevat."

msgid "Cross reference New Testament"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing Nuwe Testament"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"New Testament books."
msgstr ""
"Inhoud tussen hierdie merkers is vir insluiting in uitgawes wat die Nuwe "
"Testament-boeke bevat."

msgid "Cross reference deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Kruisverwysing deuterokanonies"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr ""
"Inhoud tussen hierdie merkers is vir insluiting in uitgawes wat die "
"Deuterokanonieke boeke bevat."

msgid "Translator’s addition"
msgstr "Vertaler se toevoeging"

msgid ""
"A translator’s explanation - words added by the translator for clarity – "
"text which is not literally a part of the original language, but which was "
"supplied to make the meaning of the original clear."
msgstr ""
"'n Vertaler se verduideliking - woorde wat deur die vertaler vir "
"duidelikheid bygevoeg is - teks wat nie letterlik deel van die oorspronklike"
" taal is nie, maar bygevoeg is om die betekenis van die oorspronklike "
"duidelik te maak."

msgid "Quoted book title"
msgstr "Aangehaalde boektitel"

msgid "For the quoted name of a book."
msgstr "Vir die aangehaalde naam van 'n boek."

msgid "Deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Deuterokanonies"

msgid ""
"Deuterocanonical / LXX additions or insertions in the Protocanonical text."
msgstr ""
"Deuterokanonieke / LXX-toevoegings of -invoegings in die Protokanonieke "
"teks."

msgid "Keyword"
msgstr "Sleutelwoord"

msgid "Keyword / keyterm."
msgstr "Sleutelwoord / sleutelterm."

msgid "Liturgical note"
msgstr "Liturgiese nota"

msgid ""
"A guide which tells the reader or worshipper that he should recite a prayer "
"or recitation etc."
msgstr ""
"'n Gids wat die leser of aanbidder vertel dat hy 'n gebed of opsegging ens. "
"moet opsê."

msgid "Name of God"
msgstr "Naam van God"

msgid "For name of God (name of Deity)."
msgstr "Vir die naam van God (naam van die Godheid)."

msgid "Ordinal number ending"
msgstr "Rangtelwoord-einde"

msgid "For the text portion of an ordinal number."
msgstr "Vir die tekstedeel van 'n rangtelwoord."

msgid "Proper name"
msgstr "Eienaam"

msgid "For a proper name."
msgstr "Vir 'n eienaam."

msgid "Geographic proper name"
msgstr "Geografiese eienaam"

msgid "For a geographic proper name."
msgstr "Vir 'n geografiese eienaam."

msgid "Combined add and pn style"
msgstr "Gekombineerde add- en pn-styl"

msgid "Support for overlapping pn ...pn* and add ...add* occurrences."
msgstr "Ondersteuning vir oorvleuelende pn ...pn* en add ...add* voorkomste."

msgid "Quoted text"
msgstr "Aangehaalde teks"

msgid "Old Testament quotations in the New Testament, or other quotations."
msgstr "Ou Testament-aanhalings in die Nuwe Testament, of ander aanhalings."

msgid "Signature of the author"
msgstr "Handtekening van die skrywer"

msgid "Signature of the author of a letter or epistle."
msgstr "Handtekening van die skrywer van 'n brief of epistel."

msgid "Secondary language source"
msgstr "Sekondêre taalbron"

msgid ""
"Passage of text based on a secondary language or alternate text source."
msgstr ""
"Gedeelte teks gebaseer op 'n sekondêre taal of alternatiewe tekstebron."

msgid "Transliterated text"
msgstr "Getranslitereerde teks"

msgid "Transliterated or foreign word or text."
msgstr "Getranslitereerde of vreemde woord of teks."

msgid "Words of Jesus"
msgstr "Woorde van Jesus"

msgid "For marking the words of Jesus."
msgstr "Vir die merk van die woorde van Jesus."

msgid "Emphasized text"
msgstr "Beklemtoonde teks"

msgid "For emphasizing a portion of text."
msgstr "Vir die beklemtoning van 'n gedeelte teks."

msgid "Bold text"
msgstr "Vet teks"

msgid "For making a portion of text bold."
msgstr "Om 'n gedeelte teks vet te maak."

msgid "Italic text"
msgstr "Kursiewe teks"

msgid "For putting some text in italics."
msgstr "Om sekere teks in kursief te plaas."

msgid "Bold-italic text"
msgstr "Vet-kursiewe teks"

msgid "For putting some text in bold and italics."
msgstr "Om sekere teks in vet en kursief te plaas."

msgid "Normal text"
msgstr "Normale teks"

msgid ""
"May be used when a larger paragraph element is set in an alternate font "
"style, e.g. italic, and a selected section of text should be displayed in "
"normal text."
msgstr ""
"Kan gebruik word wanneer 'n groter paragraafelement in 'n alternatiewe "
"lettertipestyl gestel is, bv. kursief, en 'n gekose gedeelte teks in normale"
" teks vertoon moet word."

msgid "Small-cap text"
msgstr "Kleinhoofletter-teks"

msgid "For putting some text in small capitals."
msgstr "Om sekere teks in kleinhoofletters te plaas."

msgid "Superscript text"
msgstr "Boskrifteks"

msgid "Superscript text typically for use in critical edition footnotes."
msgstr "Boskrifteks gewoonlik vir gebruik in kritiese uitgawe-voetnotas."

msgid "Page break"
msgstr "Bladsybreuk"

msgid "Explicit page break."
msgstr "Eksplisiete bladsybreuk."

msgid "Figure / illustration / map"
msgstr "Figuur / illustrasie / kaart"

msgid "Illustration [columns to span, height, filename, caption text]."
msgstr "Illustrasie [kolomme om te strek, hoogte, lêernaam, onderskrifteks]."

msgid "Subject index entry"
msgstr "Onderwerpindeksinskrywing"

msgid ""
"Surround a word or words with this markup to indicate that it should appear "
"in the subject index."
msgstr ""
"Omring 'n woord of woorde met hierdie merker om aan te dui dat dit in die "
"onderwerpindeks moet verskyn."

msgid "Annotated base text"
msgstr "Geannoteerde basisteks"

msgid "Used to mark the base text being annotated with ruby characters."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik om die basisteks te merk wat met ruby-karakters geannoteer word."

msgid "Pronunciation annotation"
msgstr "Uitspraakannotasie"

msgid "For indicating pronunciation in CJK texts."
msgstr "Om uitspraak in CJK-tekste aan te dui."

msgid "Wordlist entry"
msgstr "Woordlysinskrywing"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"word list."
msgstr ""
"Omring woorde met hierdie merker om aan te dui dat dit in die woordelys moet"
" verskyn."

msgid "Greek word list entry"
msgstr "Griekse woordlysinskrywing"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Greek word list."
msgstr ""
"Omring woorde met hierdie merker om aan te dui dat dit in die Griekse "
"woordelys moet verskyn."

msgid "Hebrew word list entry"
msgstr "Hebreeuse woordlysinskrywing"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Hebrew word list."
msgstr ""
"Omring woorde met hierdie merker om aan te dui dat dit in die Hebreeuse "
"woordelys moet verskyn."

msgid "Aramaic word list entry"
msgstr "Aramese woordlysinskrywing"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Aramaic word list."
msgstr ""
"Omring woorde met hierdie merker om aan te dui dat dit in die Aramese "
"woordelys moet verskyn."

msgid "Quotation start milestone"
msgstr "Aanhaling-begin-mylpaal"

msgid "Typically used for indicating the speaker of the text."
msgstr "Gewoonlik gebruik om die spreker van die teks aan te dui."

msgid "Quotation start milestone level 1"
msgstr "Aanhaling-begin-mylpaal vlak 1"

msgid "Quotation start milestone level 2"
