msgid ""
"To which city was Paul travelling when a light from heaven shone round about"
" him?"
msgstr ""
"Na watter stad was Paulus op reis toe 'n lig uit die hemel rondom hom geskyn"
" het?"

msgid "Damascus"
msgstr "Damaskus"

msgid ""
"And while he travelled, he came near Damascus; and suddenly a light from "
"heaven shone round about him."
msgstr ""
"En terwyl hy gereis het, het hy naby Damaskus gekom; en skielik het 'n lig "
"uit die hemel rondom hom geskyn."

msgid "What is the name of the brother of Aaron the high priest?"
msgstr "Wat is die naam van die broer van Aäron, die hoëpriester?"

msgid "Moses"
msgstr "Moses"

msgid ""
"And the anger of Jehova was kindled against Moses, and he said: Is not Aaron"
" the Levite your brother?"
msgstr ""
"En die toorn van die Here het teen Moses ontvlam, en Hy het gesê: Is Aäron, "
"die Leviet, nie jou broer nie?"

msgid "What is the name of the city where Jesus was born?"
msgstr "Wat is die naam van die stad waar Jesus gebore is?"

msgid "Bethlehem"
msgstr "Bethlehem"

msgid ""
"When Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judaea in the days of Herod the king, "
"behold, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem."
msgstr ""
"Toe Jesus in Bethlehem in Judea gebore is in die dae van koning Herodes, "
"kyk, toe het wysgere uit die ooste in Jerusalem aangekom."

msgid "What is the name of the island where John was sent to?"
msgstr "Wat is die naam van die eiland waarheen Johannes gestuur is?"

msgid "Patmos"
msgstr "Patmos"

msgid ""
"I, John, your brother and companion in the persecution, and in the kingdom "
"and endurance of Jesus Christ, was in the island called Patmos, because of "
"the word of God, and because of the testimony of Jesus Christ."
msgstr ""
"Ek, Johannes, julle broer en metgesel in die vervolging, en in die koninkryk"
" en volharding van Jesus Christus, was op die eiland genaamd Patmos, ter "
"wille van die woord van God en die getuienis van Jesus Christus."

msgid "Who is the first person to acknowledge Jesus as the Christ?"
msgstr "Wie was die eerste persoon wat Jesus as die Christus erken het?"

msgid "Simeon"
msgstr "Simeon"

msgid ""
"There was Simeon. A just and devout man. The Holy Spirit told him that he "
"will see Christ before his death."
msgstr ""
"Daar was Simeon. 'n Regverdige en godvrugtige man. Die Heilige Gees het hom "
"gesê dat hy die Christus voor sy dood sou sien."

msgid "To whom was the Acts Of Apostles written?"
msgstr "Aan wie is die Handelinge van die Apostels geskryf?"

msgid "Theophilus"
msgstr "Teofilus"

msgid ""
"The former treatise have I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both "
"to do and teach,"
msgstr ""
"Die eerste verhandeling het ek gemaak, o Teofilus, oor alles wat Jesus begin"
" het om te doen en te leer,"

msgid "Where did Jesus met the woman from Samaria?"
msgstr "Waar het Jesus die vrou van Samaria ontmoet?"

msgid "Jacob's well"
msgstr "Jakob se put"

msgid ""
"Jesus being wearied by his journey, sat on Jacob's well. Then came a woman "
"from Samaria to get water."
msgstr ""
"Jesus, moeg van die reis, het by Jakob se put gaan sit. Toe kom daar 'n vrou"
" van Samaria om water te skep."

msgid "Who was the father of Abraham?"
msgstr "Wie was die vader van Abraham?"

msgid "Terah"
msgstr "Tera"

msgid "And Terah took Abram his son,"
msgstr "En Tera het Abram, sy seun, geneem,"

msgid "Who was the son of Cush, the mighty hunter before the Lord?"
msgstr "Wie was die seun van Kus, die geweldige jagter voor die Here?"

msgid "Nimrod"
msgstr "Nimrod"

msgid "And Cush bore Nimrod. He was a mighty hunter before the Lord."
msgstr "En Kus het Nimrod gebaar. Hy was 'n geweldige jagter voor die Here."

msgid "What is the name of Job's friend that answered him first?"
msgstr "Wat is die naam van Job se vriend wat hom eerste geantwoord het?"

msgid "Eliphaz"
msgstr "Elifas"

msgid "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said to Job."
msgstr "Toe antwoord Elifas, die Temaniet, en sê vir Job."

msgid "What is the name of Ruth's husband?"
msgstr "Wat is die naam van Rut se man?"

msgid "Boaz"
msgstr "Boas"

msgid "So Boaz took Ruth as his wife."
msgstr "So het Boas Rut as sy vrou geneem."

msgid "Who taught Lemuel Proverbs chapter 31?"
msgstr "Wie het Lemuel onderrig in Spreuke hoofstuk 31?"

msgid "Lemuel's mother"
msgstr "Lemuel se moeder"

msgid "The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him."
msgstr ""
"Die woorde van koning Lemuel, die profesie wat sy moeder hom geleer het."

msgid "Who is the chosen people of God in the Old Testament?"
msgstr "Wie is die uitverkore volk van God in die Ou Testament?"

msgid "Israel"
msgstr "Israel"

msgid "Israel, you are the chosen people of the Lord your God."
msgstr "Israel, julle is die uitverkore volk van die Here, julle God."

msgid "Where did God rescue Israel from?"
msgstr "Waaruit het God Israel gered?"

msgid "Egypt"
msgstr "Egipte"

msgid "Then with his mighty arm, he rescued you from Egypt."
msgstr "Toe het Hy julle met sy magtige arm uit Egipte gered."

msgid "Who's the father of Abimelech?"
msgstr "Wie is die vader van Abimeleg?"

msgid "Gideon"
msgstr "Gideon"

msgid "Abimelech the son of Gideon went to Shechem."
msgstr "Abimeleg, die seun van Gideon, het na Sigem gegaan."

msgid "Who's the father of Joshua the priest in the time of Ezra?"
msgstr "Wie is die vader van Josua, die priester in die tyd van Esra?"

msgid "Jozadak"
msgstr "Josadak"

msgid "The priest Joshua son of Jozadak."
msgstr "Die priester Josua, seun van Josadak."

msgid "Who's the king of Babylonia, that captures Israel?"
msgstr "Wie is die koning van Babilonië wat Israel gevange neem?"

msgid "Nebuchadnezzar"
msgstr "Nebukadnesar"

msgid ""
"We were told that their people had made God angry, and he let them be "
"captured by Nebuchadnezzar, the king of Babylonia."
msgstr ""
"Ons is vertel dat hulle volk God kwaad gemaak het, en Hy het hulle deur "
"Nebukadnesar, die koning van Babilonië, laat gevange neem."

msgid ""
"Who prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus the Persian?"
msgstr ""
"Wie het voorspoedig gewees in die regering van Darius en in die regering van"
" Kores, die Pers?"

msgid ""
"So this Daniel prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus "
"the Persian."
msgstr ""
"So het hierdie Daniël voorspoedig gewees in die regering van Darius en in "
"die regering van Kores, die Pers."

msgid "Who's Abram's brother's son?"
msgstr "Wie is Abram se broer se seun?"

msgid "Lot"
msgstr "Lot"

msgid ""
"And they took Lot, Abram's brother's son, who dwelt in Sodom, and his goods,"
" and departed."
msgstr ""
"En hulle het Lot, Abram se broer se seun, wat in Sodom gewoon het, en sy "
"goed geneem en weggetrek."

msgid "Who wrote Song of Songs?"
msgstr "Wie het die Hooglied geskryf?"

msgid "Solomon"
msgstr "Salomo"

msgid "This is Solomon's most beautiful song."
msgstr "Dit is Salomo se mooiste lied."

msgid "Who's the father of Hosea?"
msgstr "Wie is die vader van Hosea?"

msgid "Beeri"
msgstr "Beëri"

msgid "I am Hosea son of Beeri."
msgstr "Ek is Hosea, seun van Beëri."

